probe_ch2_rohf_ccpvdz: CH2 triplet ROHF/cc-pVDZ (pure d), 1 frozen core, active
MOs 2-13. The polarized-basis gate for the MOKIT bridge: Gaussian and PySCF order
pure d functions differently, so this .mat/.fch pair only passes through
g16dump rebuild-fock if the AO transformation is right. Geometry as probe_ch2_rohf.

